    <string name="usage_text">1. Fill API URL+Key, tap \"🔄 Fetch\" to select model, save\n2. Tap \"Start Bubble\" → Grant \"Display over other apps\" permission\n3. On TikTok, long-press message → Copy → Tap bubble → Auto translate\n4. Type Chinese in \"My Reply\" → Generate English → Copy &amp; paste\n5. Drag bubble to move; exit from notification\n6. Tap 📋 in panel to export logs for debugging</string>

